{"id":"658725","name":"家常蛋炒饭","author":"宛馨儿爱美食","authorId":"11545388","desc":"","cover":"images/658725/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"米饭","amount":"1碗"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"小葱","amount":"2根"},{"name":"蒜瓣","amount":"3个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"备好食材。","img":"images/658725/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡蛋打散，蒜瓣，小葱切好。","img":"images/658725/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"煎鸡蛋，铲碎。","img":"images/658725/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅里放适量猪油，倒入米饭翻炒。","img":"images/658725/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"米饭翻炒均匀，粒粒分明，加入鸡蛋。","img":"images/658725/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"中途加入生抽，蒜瓣末，继续翻炒。","img":"images/658725/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"最后撒上葱花。","img":"images/658725/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/658725/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}